{"id":"msg_m_ex_wardress_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_wardress","label":"Wardress · Group"},"label":"3. Commander","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_wardress_02","next":null,"speakers":{"yuni":"Yuni","mihara":"Mihara"},"icons":{"yuni":"si_c160_00_s","mihara":"si_c161_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_1","text":"Commander","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_2","text":"Mihara and I","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_3","text":"got a strange message.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_4","text":"Did you get it too?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_5","text":"Men_and_women all welcome","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_6","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_7","text":"That's different from the message we received.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_8","text":"Ours was asking for money.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_9","text":"What kind of websites are you visiting to get spam messages like that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_10","text":"Your internet security must be terrible.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_11","text":"I resent that statement.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_12","text":"At any rate, we've been bombarded with spam messages the past few days.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_13","text":"What should we do?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_14","text":"You can block them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_15","text":"When we do, they just come through a different number.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_16","text":"They're nothing if not persistent.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_17","text":"In a strange way, I actually admire them for that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_18","text":"How about we respond and try to meet them in person?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_19","text":"I think it would be fun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_20","text":"Yuni, that's... genius!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_21","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_21","text":"Sounds a bit dangerous to me.","jump":"m_ex_wardress_03_23"},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_22","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_22","text":"An undercover investigation?","jump":"m_ex_wardress_03_26"},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_23","text":"To whom?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_24","text":"Us?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_25","text":"Or them?","jump":"m_ex_wardress_03_28"},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_26","text":"Precisely.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_27","text":"We'll sneak up on 'em without them even knowing, and then boom!","jump":"m_ex_wardress_03_28"},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_28","text":"This is gonna be fun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_29","text":"Just don't go too overboard.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_30","text":"Soon after.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_31","text":"Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_32","text":"we tried contacting them,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_33","text":"but they just keep calling me mom","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_34","text":"and asking for money.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_35","text":"This isn't any fun at all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_36","text":"We keep saying how we want to meet in person, but they aren't listening.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_37","text":"I'm quickly losing interest.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_38","text":"So, we were wondering","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_39","text":"if we could try contacting some of the spam messages that you got?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_40","text":"Yours appear a bit more scandalous, so I think it'll be more titillating.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_41","text":"No way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_42","text":"No?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_43","text":"Then","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_44","text":"can we come over to you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_45","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_45","text":"Something tells me that I'm in for a world of pain once those two get here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_46","text":"... Just give me a few minutes to prepare myself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_47","text":"Sure thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"yuni","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_48","text":"We'll be over in a few.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_49","text":"We've got a lot of things we want to do, so we may be there for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_wardress_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mihara","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_wardress_03_50","text":"See you later.","jump":null}],"chat":true}